From: hisxo <16657045+hisxo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:53:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] dsv41: the coupled drafts' top-K runs over 32 slices of
 the vocabulary, then merges

dsv41_coupled_topk_part keeps each slice's K best (value, then lower id) and dsv41_coupled_topk_merge merges the slices' lists: the same candidates in the same order as the single-block scan (unit test against a sort at lambda 0, 0.5 and 1). Markov loop at T=1: 0.56 -> 0.50 ms a pass.
---
 zig/kernels/cuda/dsv41/coupled_draft.cu | 106 +++++++++++++++---------
 zig/src/families/dsv41/draft.zig        |  20 ++++-
 2 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

diff --git a/zig/kernels/cuda/dsv41/coupled_draft.cu b/zig/kernels/cuda/dsv41/coupled_draft.cu
